&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Will You Be Doing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Day-to-day you will be expected to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build pipelines proactively: Source passive and active candidates using LinkedIn Recruiter, Boolean searches, professional communities, and other channels to create diverse, qualified talent pools for open and upcoming roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage candidates: Craft personalized outreach across email, LinkedIn, and other channels, follow up consistently, and build genuine interest in Vestwell and the opportunity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Screen and evaluate: Review inbound applications, conduct initial screening conversations, and assess candidates against defined role requirements to support objective, data-driven hiring decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with recruiters and hiring managers: Participate in intake conversations, align on role requirements and ideal candidate profiles, share market insights, and refine sourcing strategy based on feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the process in Greenhouse: Keep candidate records, notes, stages, and dispositions accurate and up to date so the team has clear visibility into pipeline health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and report: Monitor sourcing metrics such as outreach response rates, screen-to-submit ratios, and pipeline diversity, and use the data to continuously improve results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver a great candidate experience: Communicate clearly and promptly, represent Vestwell&#39;s brand and culture, and ensure candidates feel respected whatever the outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the team: Share best practices, help improve sourcing playbooks and templates, and support employer branding and recruiting events as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end candidate interview process, from conducting initial interview screens to coordinating virtual and on-site interview panels across multiple time zones and stakeholder groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Necessities:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1–3 years of experience in sourcing or recruiting, in an agency, in-house, or high-growth environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success building pipelines for professional roles; experience with technical, fintech, or other specialized hiring is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with LinkedIn Recruiter and advanced search techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with an applicant tracking system, ideally Greenhouse&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience reviewing applications and conducting candidate screens against defined role criteria&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to partner effectively with recruiters, hiring managers, and other stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Extras:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in startup and or FinTech environment(s)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will be based in our Austin office, and will be part of Vestwell&#39;s hybrid in-office operation.&lt;/p&gt;
