&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal, written, follow-up, and organization skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with inbound and outbound phone calls from individuals saving in 401(k), 403(b), IRA, 529, ESA, and other workplace savings plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PC literacy; experience with Zendesk and Jira is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team mentality and the ability to multitask while attending to a high volume of incoming inquiries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible and adaptable to constantly changing responsibilities and assignments&lt;/li&gt;
