&lt;p&gt;If you are someone who dives into whatever challenge is placed in front of you, you will find yourself&amp;nbsp; involved in the planning and coordinating our overall AI-BI solutions, working with our Technical Director and his data engineering team to develop new research models and predictive analysis tooling.&lt;/p&gt;
