&lt;li&gt;Ability to define and plan overall ML strategy with our Technical Director&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to define and write algorithms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2-3+ years of Product Management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional business and systems analysis skills&lt;/li&gt;
