&lt;li&gt;Preparing materials, presentations, project trackers, and other work documents for state clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Presenting at board meetings or other public meetings (in-person and remotely)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gathering data and answering program-specific questions for clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handling escalations of customer service issues with support from Vestwell service teams; reporting resolutions to clients&lt;/li&gt;
