&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engaging with new/potential state client partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tracking and reporting on state activity and new program opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintaining relationships with Treasurers’ / State Government staff and continuing to serve as a subject matter expert&lt;/li&gt;
