&lt;p&gt;This role will be based in either the New York City, Austin, King of Prussia, or Scottsdale office, and will be part of Vestwell&#39;s hybrid in-office operation. For exceptional candidates with 5+ years of specific experience, we&#39;re open to hiring this role fully remote.&lt;/p&gt;
