&lt;p&gt;The Vestwell Government Savings Auto IRA team is responsible for ensuring that our clients are continuously receiving and recognizing value from the retirement platform that we are building. You will work closely with state clients to understand their business objectives and develop success plans that enable Vestwell to meet those objectives. The Auto IRA Relationship Manager will support existing State Retirement Auto-IRA Program clients to ensure execution on agreed upon deliverables, ongoing alignment of business objectives, and that our state clients are continuously receiving and recognizing value from the retirement platform we offer. This individual will collaborate with the team in the development of success plans that enable Vestwell to meet our Auto IRA goals. This role will provide an opportunity to experience the entire ecosystem of State Program Relationship Management - from business development, to product ideation, to implementation, and ongoing support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Day-to-Day, You May Also Be Expected To:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the relationship with some of our State partners, serving as their point person for Vestwell’s program administration of State Auto-IRA Programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct regular State client meetings, proactively identifying risks and mitigations of issues as they arise, to ensure the successful delivery of our solutions according to clients’ needs and objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with Product, Engineering, Marketing, Technology, Finance, Operations, and Legal teams to communicate and ensure we meet the needs, SLAs, and adherence to all requisite State Program administration requirements (e.g. introducing new product features, coordinating program launch strategies, managing response to escalated issues, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure implementation of ongoing relationship strategies and initiatives are optimized to enable teams to achieve its State Plan launch and ongoing administration goals&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and execute success plans to optimize client relationships, adoption, and satisfaction with Vestwell&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate with clients regularly through email, phone, online presentations, screen share and in-person meetings to understand their current needs and ongoing requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain subject matter expertise on our products and services and industry compliance requirements to provide timely, professional, and knowledgeable customer support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assisting Sales/Operations teams with RFP responses for new state program opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Necessities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A myriad of experience in a client-facing Retirement/Wealth Management/&amp;nbsp;Advisory, or as a Customer Success/ Relationship Manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to understand and translate business goals into actionable and measurable initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in building relationships and garnering trust with executive decision makers and influencers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of government services, the financial industry, or financial service technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capable of working collaboratively across multiple organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with managing escalations and executing on success plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter who is extremely organized and detail oriented strategic and outside of the box thinker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational, analytical, and prioritization skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong skills with Office suite, including excel and PowerPoint&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Extras&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic knowledge of project management, client onboarding experience including setting targets, KPIs, and reporting progress&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding and knowledge of state-administered Auto-IRA programs or experience working with other state programs, including governing boards and staff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will be based in Vestwell’s New York office, and will be part of Vestwell&#39;s hybrid in-office operation.&lt;/p&gt;
