&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of Product Management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business and systems analysis skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thoroughly understand and document business/functional requirements and business use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in the software development lifecycle in an Agile environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in a fast-paced, project-oriented environment and meet deadlines under tight time constraints&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently as well as collaboratively across Product, Engineering, QA, and Operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with SQL and data integrations (e.g., APIs, JSON, XML, file-based integrations)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Extras&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;FinTech or financial services experience, especially recordkeeping, payments, or other transaction-based systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;529, ABLE, or other government savings program experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building internal or operational tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort using AI tools in your day-to-day PM workflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will be based in either the New York City, Austin, or King of Prussia office, and will be part of Vestwell&#39;s hybrid in-office operation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The expected base salary range for this position is $135K - $145K base. This position is eligible to participate in the Company Bonus Pool and is eligible to receive new hire equity in the Company. Please note that salary bands are based on NY and other similar metro areas and may differ based on where the role is ultimately hired.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-Time Employee Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We’re an innovative, high-growth company with an exciting future ahead. At Vestwell, we prioritize employee wellbeing through comprehensive health benefits, generous time off, and a dedicated Employee Wellbeing Committee. Our hybrid work model offers flexibility while providing access to our collaborative offices in Midtown Manhattan, Austin, King of Prussia, and Scottsdale. And, of course, as a company focused on helping people save for the future, we offer a competitive 401(k) plan.&lt;/p&gt;
