&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Excel or Google Sheets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Word or Google Docs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Adobe Acrobat&lt;/li&gt;
